Talk.Snailsonality.Sad : nonoverlap_pool
{
	"\1\b[10]I miss my friends."
	"\1\b[10]I enjoy snoetry a lot actually, but I can't write it anymore. It's shameful..."
	"\1\b[10]Sometimes I wonder if I'll ever get to read a snoem aloud again."
	"\1\b[10]I'm trying to find other hobbies to keep my mind off of things. Like %(CurrentSnail.AltHobby)."
	"\1\b[10]When I'm on the track, I forget how lost I feel. We should race soon."
	"\1\b[10]Too sad to move...\n\n ... But, I guess I could move for a race."
	"\1\b[10]Maybe if I sleep all day things will go back to normal..."
	"\1\b[10]I should have stayed home."
	"\1\b[10]I wanted to be one of the greats, but how can I be with my name like this?"
	"\1\b[10]Even my mucus feels strange to me now. I don't know what to do."
	"\1\b[10]%(AlliterativeName)... That would have been a cool name, why couldn't I have gotten that?"
	"\1\b[10]Maybe I'll try writing %(ahaiku)... It's not the same, but a challenge is good, right...?"
	"\1\b[10]I was a good snoet. I thought so, anyway. It doesn't mean anything now, though..."
	"\1\b[10]I know some snails have moved on, but I can't. It eats at me, you know?\n\n I was so happy before..."
	"\1\b[10]Need some lettuce to chew on, to make the feelings go away..."
	"\1\b[10]Do you think if I'm sad for too long I'll eventually melt into a snail puddle...?"
	"\1\b[10]I kinda just want to sleep... Like, all the time. But if I sleep forever then I can't win races..."
	"\1\b[10]Feel like I'm going in circles... I miss when I felt like my life had direction."
	"\1\b[10]I'm just trying to keep oozing along... Put one bit of my foot in front of the other."
	"\1\b[10]I don't know how the other snails keep their tentacles up, life will never be the same and I just don't know how to cope..."

	//Maybe I'd feel better if I was the coolest looking snail ever. ... But it's kinda hard to compete with the legendary cool snails of the past... Do I really stand a chance? //could change based on coolness level
}

Talk.Snailsonality.Relaxed : nonoverlap_pool
{
	"\1\b[10]Honestly, life is better when you let go and stop worrying about what others think of you."
	"\1\b[10]Traditions aren't everything."
	"\1\b[10]There's so much pressure in snail culture to conform. I was devastated when I got my racer name and couldn't anymore.\n\n But now I see it differently. I didn't realize how stressed I was. I didn't realize how much I was being held back. I'm much happier now, just being me."
	"\1\b[10]Vroom vroom, I'm excited for the next race!"
	"\1\b[10]It's nice out here. A warm breeze, some clouds for shade, the smell of grease... I like it."
	"\1\b[10]I try not to be uppity about snail stuff. There's too much of that in the world as it is, and young snails could really use more acceptance."
	"\1\b[10]There's a big change happening in snail culture, and I'm here for it. Although, I can't agree with snails that want to fully wipe out our traditions, our history is important to preserve!"
	"\1\b[10]The change in snail naming conventions came as a huge shock, and is going to heavily affect the younger generations. But I'm hopeful that it will lead to a more open and accepting snail culture, rather than dividing us. Gotta do my part to push it that way!"
	"\1\b[10]Hey, do you have any %(popcorn) around here? I kinda want a snack."
	"\1\b[10]I checked out your %(refrigerator) while you were gone. Interesting stuff!"
	"\1\b[10]I'm ready to race! ... Juuust as soon as I take a nap to charge up."
	"\1\b[10]I like to nibble the edges of lettuce leaves before diving into the juicy center. It's the prime lettuce-eating experience!"
	"\1\b[10]I kinda feel like singing the snail song!\n\n %(note) Snail snail~ %(note)\n\n %(note) Snail snail snail~ %(note)\n\n %(note) Snail~ %(note)\n\n %(note) Snail snail~ %(note)"
	"\1\b[10]Win or lose, racing is exhilarating!"
	"\1\b[10]I've heard other snails say the glass is half empty, but I disagree. It may only be filled halfway with water, but I'm in there taking up space too!"
	"\1\b[10]I feel like today might just be my day. We should race!"
	"\1\b[10]I wished upon a shooting star last night. ... I mean yeah I couldn't see it, but I felt it, you know?\n\n Anyway, today would be a great day to race!"
	"\1\b[10]I think more snails should try %(CurrentSnail.AltHobby). It's pretty fun!"
	"\1\b[10]Poetry comes from the heart. And my heart says %(PoetryType('haiku','cinquain','limericks','acrostic','lyrics','rhyming couplets','alternate rhymes','free verse','diamante','concrete poetry'))!"
	"\1\b[12]Those birds have been vicious this week, make sure to find a safe shelter! I've been hiding out %(inthefridge), personally."
	
	//This may need to change based on weather... or maybe it could be a weather radio dialogue
	//The sun has been killer this week, make sure to stay moisturized! I've been hiding out %(inthefridge), personally.
	//My snailoscope said %(snailoscope). What do you think it means? //TODO i....... don't know what horoscopes are actually like lol. but if we do this i wanna seed it per snail per day lolllllll - wait what if they all have the same snailoscope each day, hmmmmm
}

Talk.Snailsonality.Angry : nonoverlap_pool
{
	"\1\b[10]I DON'T RACE BECAUSE I ENJOY IT. I RACE TO SHOW THE OTHERS HOW IT'S DONE!"
	"\1\b[10]I'M NOT LIKE THOSE OTHER SNAILS THAT ALL TALK THE SAME. WHO WANTS TO BE PART OF A GROUP WHERE EVERYONE GETS ALONG AND HAS FUN RACING TOGETHER, ANYWAY? NOT ME!"
	"\1\b[10]LET'S GO GRAFFITI THE RACETRACK."
	"\1\b[10]UGH.\n\n NOT ANY PARTICULAR UGH. UGH IN GENERAL. AN EVERYTHING UGH."
	"\1\b[12]SNOTTY SNAILS SOMETHING SOMETHING WHATEVER I DON'T CARE SNOETRY SUCKS"
	"\1\b[12]SEE YOU ON THE RACE TRACK, YOUR FANCY WORDS WON'T HELP YOU THEN"
	"\1\b[10]STEALING SOME SNOETRY, SUCKERS\n\n HAHA SEE WHAT I DID THERE"
	"\1\b[10]YEAH I'M LOUD, GOT A PROBLEM???"
	"\1\b[10]AAAAAAAAAAAAAA"
	"\1\b[12]AND THEN IT SAID, '\![embed,OnAngryQuoteBasic]', CAN YOU BELIEVE IT?"
	"\1\b[10]IF BIRDS CAN MAKE THEMSELVES SHINY WHY CAN'T I, DOWN WITH SNAIL WASHES"
	"\1\b[10]YOU THINK THIS IS LOUD? \f[bold,1]I'LL SHOW YOU LOUD!!!\f[bold,default]"
	"\1\b[10]GET ME A NEW %(TOUPPER(engine)) THIS ONE SUCKS"
	"\1\b[10]I DON'T FEAR BIRDS, THEY FEAR \f[bold,1]ME! \f[bold,default]AAAAAAAAAAAA"
	"\1\b[10]I'M READY TO CRACK SOME SHELLS OUT ON THE TRACK"
	"\1\b[10]TRAINING IS FOR CHUMPS, I WAS BORN WITH ALL THE SKILL I NEED"
	"\1\b[10]GET ME A FLAMETHROWER SO WE CAN %(ANY('ROAST','SMOKE','TORCH')) THE COMPETITION"
	"\1\b[12]I WRITE THE BEST %(TOUPPER(PoetryType('haiku','cinquains','limericks','acrostics','lyrics','rhyming couplets','alternate rhymes','free verse','diamantes','concrete poems'))) THE SNAIL WORLD HAS EVER SEEN. BECAUSE \f[bold,1]MINE\f[bold,default] ARE IN \f[bold,1]UPPERCASE!!!\f[bold,default]"
	"\1\b[10]ESCARGOT? \f[bold,1]ME? \f[bold,default]I'LL MAKE YOUR FACE ESCARGOT IF YOU TRY IT"
	"\1\b[10]CAN'T THEY THINK OF ANYTHING BETTER TO PLAY ON THE RADIO?"
	
	// BAGEL WAS SAYING YOU DON'T FEED US ENOUGH
	// if angry is fed
	// WHAT A LIAR
	// if angry is not fed
	// AND ITS RIGHT, SO I STARTED A PETITION
}

